stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: Recovery is not yet readiness for failback
accDescr: After an outage the standby serves writes. When primary infrastructure returns, the standby continues serving until application and replicated data readiness are verified.
[*] --> PrimaryServing
PrimaryServing --> StandbyServing: Primary unhealthy, standby ready
StandbyServing --> PrimaryRecovering: Primary infrastructure returns
PrimaryRecovering --> CatchingUp: Application restored
CatchingUp --> ReadyToReturn: Required data and app checks pass
ReadyToReturn --> PrimaryServing: Primary health enabled, DNS failback
note right of CatchingUp
Standby continues serving
Wait for replication and reconciliation
end note
